Activity
--------
The bottom bar says what Lumen is doing: importing, making thumbnails,
exporting, reading a raw photo, checking the photos' files. The ring
beside it fills as the job goes on; it turns when Lumen can't tell how
far it has got. When the job is done the bar says what happened, for a
minute.

Click it (or choose Activity... on the icon bar menu) for the Activity
window: everything running now, each with how far it has got, and then
what Lumen has done, newest first: imports, thumbnails, exports, new
photos in watched folders, and any problems (in red). The list is kept
between sessions in <Choices$Write>.Lumen.Activity, a text file; Clear
history empties it.

Thumbnails are made in the background: the photos on screen first, then
the rest. While Lumen is in front it uses the desktop's spare time
freely; while another program is in front it works in short slices and
gives the others the time in between.

